+ * Silent updates (Android 12+): once "Install unknown apps" is allowed, the checked APK is written
+ * into a PackageInstaller session of this app's own package with USER_ACTION_NOT_REQUIRED and
+ * committed right after the link's answer went out (a silent install replaces this process). The
+ * answer's `silent` says whether Android's rule lets it go through without the user (installer
